    2. Draw 1-5 blue (1) path/chain structures using random walks on the grid;
       paths should be mostly degree-2 (no thick blobs), total ~45 blue cells
    3. Choose 3-6 distinct marker colors from {2..9}; optionally duplicate one
    4. Label all black and blue 4-connected components
    5. Place markers one at a time on black cells, ensuring each is adjacent
